set.body:
Add coordinate-dependent sparsity only through explicit stable charts.

Families:
- elementwise l1;
- feature-row l21 across components;
- disjoint group penalties;
- sparse-group and elastic-net combinations;
- nonnegativity, monotonicity, boxes, and simplexes on charted coordinates where separable lowering is valid.

Groups carry feature-space identity and overlap metadata. This issue covers only identity, orthogonal, tight-frame, selection, and genuinely block-separable compositions with valid direct proximal or projection operations.

Acceptance:
- parity fixtures against a documented R reference;
- exact small-problem convex oracle;
- chart mismatch and overlapping-group cases reject direct separable lowering;
- symmetry/result-contract tests distinguish sparse frames from sparse subspaces;
- JVM/JS green.
